          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio malaika owa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Yoshua ali ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami Owe Banamae aloma ali, “Waaba ne oria kamalaka kase ne khukhola kimilimo nikio khuelesie, aba olachiililila khuliinda Lukaangu lwase ne luuya lwalwo, lundi ndaulila kamasaba kowo, bulayi bwene nga ne mbulilanga kamasaba ke bamalaika bali ebweeni wase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.23.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer. 23.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.33.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "33.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.6.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Sak. 6.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yoshua, ewe ooli Omusaayi Omukhulu Lukali, ne basaayi basio rekeeresia, sikila enywe muli silolelo silayi sie chindaalo chichiicha. Ndekesia omukholi wase, olaangwa bali Lusakia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndikho nda ebweeni wa Yoshua libaale lilala liong'ene lie chimbeka saba. Ndabechakho kamaandike, mala khu ndaalo ndala yong'ene ndarusiao bubwoni bwe sibala sino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MIC.4.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mik. 4.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Endaalo eyo ne yola buli mulala khwinywe alilanga owasie khukhwicha asangaalile kumuleembe ne buliindi. Ne buli mulala aliba akari we biluundu biewe bie kimisabibu ne kimituli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
